      ],
      "en": "David went up at the saying of Gad, which he spoke in the LORD’s name.",
      "ko": "다윗이 이에 갓이 여호와의 이름으로 이른 말씀대로 올라가니라",
      "source_text_hash": "594dd3ba61cde60fc861dea2200224ecb19a5269d3d68eac72ac589db2cd41b7",
      "translation_text_hash": "b07ea4c1d1993c9c9fd4c83ade60040ece05ed0c5fe218c6e7980e6a24c04b3e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "다윗이 이에 갓이 여호와의 이름으로 이른 말씀대로 올라가니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b07ea4c1d1993c9c9fd4c83ade60040ece05ed0c5fe218c6e7980e6a24c04b3e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:1CH:21:20",
      "sequence": 10955,
      "chapter_label": "1CH 21",
      "verse_label": "20",
      "locator": {
        "book": "1CH",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 20
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 21,
          "verse": 20
        }
      ],
      "en": "Ornan turned back and saw the angel; and his four sons who were with him hid themselves. Now Ornan was threshing wheat.",
      "ko": "때에 오르난이 밀을 타작하다가 돌이켜 천사를 보고 네 아들과 함께 숨었더니",
      "source_text_hash": "60f91bde1714f45ac881ab0166c85524d8c9261ecbd658ab2bb3b9d9f65963e1",
      "translation_text_hash": "2634c5e03a29cb4d07817e4f0315fe3f3825710efa339049566c2b9bdd55ecd8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "때에 오르난이 밀을 타작하다가 돌이켜 천사를 보고 네 아들과 함께 숨었더니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "2634c5e03a29cb4d07817e4f0315fe3f3825710efa339049566c2b9bdd55ecd8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:1CH:21:21",
      "sequence": 10956,
      "chapter_label": "1CH 21",
      "verse_label": "21",
